  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno lukwena ki utmego ma gitye i Jerucalem guwinyo ni Lurok bene doŋ guye lok pa Lubaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Petero ocito i Jerucalem, ci dul pa jo ma mito ni jo muye Kricito myero koŋ gilirgi gucako ŋono en, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun giwaco ni, “Piŋo nene icito bot jo ma pe gilirogi ci icamo kwedgi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Petero ogamo, ocako tito botgi ki kore kun wacci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I kare ma abedo i gaŋ me Jopa ma abedo ka lega, ci awille woko. Aneno gin mo ma lor piny macalo cuka madit ki i waŋ lek, kun bino piny ma tye ki twoke aŋwen, ci olor wa piny i nyima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka aŋiyo kome cok, ci aneno iye lee, ki ŋuu ma camo riŋo, ki kwa anyai ducu ki winyo me polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci awinyo dwan ma wacca ni, ‘Petero, a malo inek wek icam.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento agamo ni ‘Pe, Rwot, pien peya jami ata ki me kwer odonyo i doga.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento dwan odok iye ki i polo ni, ‘Gin ma Lubaŋa olonyo in pe ilwoŋ ni obedo me kwer.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man otimme tyen adek, ci jami meno gidwoko woko i polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno kikome en aye jo adek ma gicwalogi bota ki i Cecaria guo kwede i ot ma yam watye iye-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cwiny Maleŋ otitta ni awot kwedgi, ma pe apoko kin dano. Anywako wot ki utmego man abicel, ka wadonyo i ot pa dano meno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci en otito botwa kit ma oneno ki lamalaika ocuŋ kwede i ode kun wacce ni, ‘Cwal kwena i Jopa wek guom Cimon ma gilwoŋo Petero; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "en aye bititti lok ma bilaro in ki jo ma i odi ducu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma acako lok, ci Cwiny Maleŋ opye i komgi kit ma con okwoŋo pye i komwa-ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 1.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ci apo lok ma yam Rwot owaco, ni, ‘Jon yam obatija dano ki pii, ento wun gibibatijawu ki Cwiny Maleŋ.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ce Lubaŋa omiyogi mot ma rom ki ma omiyowa i kare ma waye iye Rwot Yecu Kricito, ci an aŋa ma atwero pyem ki Lubaŋa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka guwinyo lok man, ci guliŋ litik, ka gucako pako kun giwaco ni, “Lurok bene Lubaŋa doŋ omiyogi ŋut me donyo i kwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.1+ACT.8.2+ACT.8.3+ACT.8.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 8.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Jo ma yam guket i kare me libo ma ocakke i kom Citefano-ni guwoto nio wa Poiniki ki Caiprac ki Antiokia, kun pe gitito lok bot ŋat mo, kono bot Lujudaya keken. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento jo mukene i kingi, jo me Caiprac ki me Cirene, ka guo i Antiokia ci guloko ki Lugrik bene kun gitito pi Rwot Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot oketo ciŋe i komgi, ci lwak jo mapol gulokke bote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok man owinynye bot jo muye Kricito ma i Jerucalem, ci gucwalo Barnaba i Antiokia.. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka oo ci oneno tic me kica pa Lubaŋa, cwinye obedo yom iye. Ocuko cwinygi me moko i kom Rwot matek ki cwinygi ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onoŋo en dano maber ma opoŋ ki Cwiny Maleŋ ki niye. Ci lwak jo mapol gumedde bot Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaba ocito Taruco ka yenyo Paulo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka onoŋe ci okele i Antiokia. Gubedo kacel ki jo muye Kricito pi mwaka kulu kun gipwonyo lwak jo mapol. Nyiŋ lupwonye gikwoŋo lwoŋo ni Jo pa Kricito ki i Antiokia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno lunebi mogo gua ki i Jerucalem gucito i Antiokia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 21.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ŋat acel i kingi ma nyiŋe Agabo ocuŋ ci otito lok pi Cwiny Maleŋ ma onyutte lok ma i anyim, ni waŋ mo kec bipoto i lobo ducu; ci otimme i kare pa Kalaudio ma laloc madit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pieno lupwonynye gumoko ni ŋat acel acel omi kony ki utmego ma gibedo i Judaya macalo twero; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci gutimo kit meno, ka gucwalo bot ludoŋo kun Barnaba ki Caulo aye gitero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
